    "title": "Russia’s Communist Party proposes adding seized crypto to national reserves",
    "summary": "Incorporating seized crypto into national reserves could diversify assets but raises concerns about volatility and regulatory challenges.\nThe post Russia’s Communist Party proposes adding seized crypto to national reserves appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://cryptobriefing.com/russia-communist-party-seized-crypto-reserves/",
